      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The viewpoint position being incorrect (in the chest instead of the head) is possibly related to the incorrect placement of the viewpoint in VR as well.\n\nI have found that a custom prone animation with a centered head and root transform set to \"Bake Into Pose\" based on Original (https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/257544996486512641/486233008307830804/bake_into_pose.png) fixes it, and these simple fixes have not been applied to the default prone animations.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
